1 NOTE <p>Interesting story behind this man, went to teach in Signapore around WW2, Singapore was identified as a secure place however the Japanese army found their way in by going down rivers using reeds to
2 CONC  breath and captured everyone in the village, he was shot after two years in a concentration camp and buried in a mass grave. Headstone erected in Fanavolty as a memorial. Married a lady who came from
2 CONC  an island off Australia and they had three children.</p>
