1 NOTE <div class="subscriber-preview" style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #333333; font-family: Lato, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;">
<p style="box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 24px; color: #444444
2 CONC ; font-size: 20px; line-height: 28px; font-family: Yrsa, serif;">PERTH, Western Australia - Irene McConigley, 93, mother of Casper resident Patrick McConigley, died on June 12, 2007 in Perth, Western 
2 CONC Australia. Her granddaughter, Nina McConigley of Casper, who had been with her for almost three months, was by her side when she died.</p>
</div>
<div class="subscriber-preview" style="box-sizing: b
2 CONC order-box; color: #333333; font-family: Lato, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;">
<p style="box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 24px; color: #444444; font-size: 20px; line-height: 28px; font-family: Y
2 CONC rsa, serif;">She was born in the Phillipines to William Engleburtus Wichman and Anna May Ryan on Nov. 6, 1913.</p>
</div>
<div class="subscriber-only" style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #333333; 
2 CONC font-family: Lato, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;">
<p style="box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 24px; color: #444444; font-size: 20px; line-height: 28px; font-family: Yrsa, serif;">She met and ma
2 CONC rried John McConigley of Donegal, Ireland in Singapore in 1938. When her husband was taken prisoner by the Japanese when Singapore fell in 1942, she was repatriated with her children to Australia unti
2 CONC l the end of the war.</p>
</div>
<div id="tncms-region-article_instory_top" class="tncms-region hidden-print" style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #333333; font-family: Lato, sans-serif; font-size:
2 CONC  14px;">&nbsp;</div>
<div class="subscriber-only" style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #333333; font-family: Lato, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;">
<p style="box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 2
2 CONC 4px; color: #444444; font-size: 20px; line-height: 28px; font-family: Yrsa, serif;">In 1945, when her husband was declared to have died in Borneo in a prisoner of war camp, she came to the United Stat
2 CONC es and lived in Las Vegas.</p>
</div>
<div class="subscriber-only" style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #333333; font-family: Lato, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;">
<p style="box-sizing: border-box;
2 CONC  margin: 0px 0px 24px; color: #444444; font-size: 20px; line-height: 28px; font-family: Yrsa, serif;">She moved back to Perth, Western Australia in 1971 and had lived there for the past 36 years until
2 CONC  her death.</p>
</div>
<div class="subscriber-only" style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #333333; font-family: Lato, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;">
<p style="box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0p
2 CONC x 24px; color: #444444; font-size: 20px; line-height: 28px; font-family: Yrsa, serif;">Survivors include a daughter, Mary Lou Duffy and her husband of Surrey, England; sons, Patrick McConigley and his
2 CONC  wife of Casper and John McConigley and his wife of Perth, Western Australia.</p>
</div>
<div id="tncms-region-article_instory_middle" class="tncms-region hidden-print" style="box-sizing: border-box
2 CONC ; color: #333333; font-family: Lato, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;">&nbsp;</div>
<div class="subscriber-only" style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #333333; font-family: Lato, sans-serif; font-size: 1
2 CONC 4px;">
<p style="box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 24px; color: #444444; font-size: 20px; line-height: 28px; font-family: Yrsa, serif;">She is also survived by eight grandchildren and six great
2 CONC -grandchildren.</p>
</div>
<div class="subscriber-only" style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #333333; font-family: Lato, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;">
<p style="box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0p
2 CONC x 0px 24px; color: #444444; font-size: 20px; line-height: 28px; font-family: Yrsa, serif;">She was cremated after a private family ceremony on June 19, 2007 in Perth. A family gathering for the dispos
2 CONC ition of her ashes will be held at a later date in Perth, Western Australia.</p>
</div>
