1 NOTE <p>[FT_Art_Na_MAacioch.FTW]</p><p><p></p></p><p>This entry is somewhat speculative, in that it is based on some vague recollections of Big Paddy Callaghan, who suggested that an Art Og would have an A
2 CONC rt as a father. Paddy also suggested that Art Senior was known as Art na Marcioch - or similar - based on the nature of the soleless overshoes that he wore. His birthplace of Gartan is also speculativ
2 CONC e, and is based on the suggestion by Paddy that Art Og came from Gartan.
