4 CONC Notes: Rose M. (nee McElwain) Friel, 90, a longtime resident of Norwood, passed away on January 7, 2012 at Broomall Presbyterian Village.  She was born May 3, 1921 in Ridley Twp. the daughter of the l
4 CONC ate Patrick and Rose Anne (nee McGonigal) McElwain.  Rose was a graduate of Notre Dame High School and was a loyal employee for the 1st Pennsylvania Banking System.  In addition to her parents she was
4 CONC  also preceded in death by her husband William Friel; and her siblings Joseph, Edward, John and Charlie Pat McElwain.  She is survived by her children William P. Friel (Marie), Rosemarie Keenan (Josep
4 CONC h) and Thomas P. Friel (Marylynne); her grandchildren Commander Joseph (U.S. Navy), Shawn, Katie Rose, Bridget, Chuck and Christina Rebecca; also survived by her great grandson Joseph Michael III and 
4 CONC her many nieces and nephews.  Relatives and friends are invited to her visitation Thursday 8:30am at the Cavanagh Family Funeral Home 301 Chester Pike, Norwood.  A Funeral Mass will be held Thursday 1
4 CONC 0am in the Church of St. Gabriel, Mohawk Ave., Norwood.  Interment will follow in Holy Cross Cemetery, Yeadon.
