4 CONC  class="highlight-text"&amp;gt;Herbert&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt; "Herb." Died February 14, beloved husband of Sandra
(Gerry, Pitzer) for 64 years. Loving father of Susan (Patrick) Scott, Judy (Jeffrey) Pre
4 CONC sant, Vicki (Richard) Dott,
and Lauri (Kevin) Bronson. Proud PopPop of Jenna and Michaela Scott, Zachary and Julia Presant, Richard Dott, Tori Dott McDonnell, and
