1 NOTE <p>Thomas was a seaman in the English Royal Navy for 7 months. Reason for discharge was "Invd". This may be Invalid and that he was not able to physically carry out his duties.</p>
<p>He departed fro
2 CONC m Glasgow and arrived in the US 12 Apr 1909. The Passenger List gives his occupation as florist/gardener. He lived and worked in Louisiana and Georgia in that occupation.</p>
<p>When he learned of hi
2 CONC s heart condition, he moved to Philadelphia and lived with his sister Mary Coll Walsh. After just 7 months, he died.</p>
<p>Unable to locate a marriage.</p>
