4 CONC ;lt;/span&amp;gt; &amp;lt;span class="highlight-text"&amp;gt;P.&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt; on July 15,
2010, age 77. Resident of Phila., born and raised in Bristol, PA. Beloved husband of Margaret (nee McSt
4 CONC ravock). Devoted father of Bob
(Janet), Meg Houseman (Jim), John (Lori) and Gerard (Janet) &amp;lt;span class="highlight-text"&amp;gt;McHugh&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;. Proud Pop
of Megan, Rob, Meganne (Tom
