 OBITUARY for Mae D. McConigly; recent residence: GA; published by H.M. Patterson & Son-Spring Hill Chapel. Family-Placed
Death Notice Mae D. McConigly, 86 of Mariett
4 CONC a died October 4, 2003. Mrs. McConigly was
born December 6, 1916 in Valdosta, Georgia. She is the daughter of Hartridge Lester Deloach and America Deloach. Mrs. McConigly was a member of First Baptist
4 CONC  Church since 1937. She was preceded in death by Arthur B. Stallworth
and Ralph D. McConigly. Her two sons and daughter-in-laws,
Michael and Jane Stallworth of Conyers, Georgia and David and Maureen S
4 CONC tallworth of Marietta, Georgia, six grandchildren and four
great-grandchildren survive her. As well as stepdaughter and step-son-in-law, David and Pam Hughes; stepson and stepdaughter-in-law, Ralph
an
4 CONC d Ruth McConigly; three step-grandchildren and 2 step-great-grandchildren. Funeral Services will be
held from H.M. Patterson and Son Spring Hill Chapel at 2:00 p.m. Tuesday, October 7, 2003. In lieu o
4 CONC f flowers donations can be made to
First Baptist Church of Atlanta. H.M. Patterson & Son Spring Hill Chapel, 404-876-1022.
