1 PUBL MyHeritage
1 TEXT The same person will often occur in previous or subsequent editions of the same yearbook and these related yearbooks are presented at the bottom of the individual’s record – to assist the research
2 CONC er in finding other books where their person of interest might be found.
2 CONC This collection is a name index produced by MyHeritage from the <a href="/research/collection-10568/us-yearbooks-1890-1979">U.S. Yearbooks, 1890-1979</a> collection and is based on the same set of yea
2 CONC rbooks. Thanks to this name index users will enjoy improved name searching and more relevant <a href="http://www.myheritage.com/help-center#/path/951695781">Record Matches</a> to their family members 
2 CONC found in these books. In case you didn’t find what you were looking for, we encourage you to check out the U.S Yearbooks 1890-1979 collection to search the entire free-text index of this amazing col
2 CONC lection.
