1 PUBL MyHeritage
1 TEXT The district given in a record refers primarily to an electoral district, city, or township within New South Wales; however, the point of reference may also be a street or intersection. The vast major
2 CONC ity of the marriages took place in New South Wales, with a small minority that took place in Queensland, Tasmania, or elsewhere.
