1 TITL New Zealand, Birth Index, 1840-1901
1 PUBL MyHeritage
1 TEXT Births have been officially recorded in New Zealand since 1848, and were originally under the jurisdiction of the Colonial Secretary. If a birth was a stillbirth it is indicated in the record. The rec
2 CONC ords in this collection are provided by the New Zealand <a id="" href="http://www.dia.govt.nz/" class="green" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Department of Internal Affairs</a>.
1 _TYPE Collection
1 _MEDI 10970
